  "chain": [
    "MCU channel 0 CAN 0x261/sub 0: descriptor 0xDF890 extracts 10 bits and associates property 0x26100008.",
    "Framework getTextInfo reads device 1007/FID 0x26100008 as integer; native Binder transaction 5 takes two int32 arguments.",
    "BusinessUi2::updateWarningInfo at 0x182DC0 reads UINT16 FID 0x26100008, gates visibility and admits an ID only if in its initialized set.",
    "Admitted value is stored unchanged at this+0x20; updateCommonWarningInfoDisplay at 0x1826E0 publishes integer DataItem 0x320 (800 decimal)/commonWarningInfoId, directly or by a 500 ms timer.",
    "PopupMsgHandle::OnDataItemUpdateInt at 0x44554C: the DataItem 0x320 (800 decimal) jump table leads to 0x4455A8; value is stored in WarnId.warn_id at offset 24 decimal and deferred emit_signal(sig_warn_id,WarnId).",
    "common_mgr connects sig_warn_id→right_area_arb.slot_recv_pop_261; arbitration emits sig_trip_popup_261.",
    "Popup261Mgr stores warnId.warn_id, formats uppercase hexadecimal %X, and performs an exact string lookup by id in the popup_nads.json dictionary.",
    "ScenePopup261 copies original icon/text/textColor, passes text through tr(), then PopupNormal assigns label text/font color. Translation/theme/layout may affect final output."
  ],
  "gates": {
    "nativeRequired": [
      "FID 0x26F00000 == 1",
      "FID 0x26F00028 == 3",
      "FID 0x26100000 == 1",
      "warning ID in BusinessUi2 allowlist"
    ],
    "nativeAdditional": "this+0x133 suppresses; this+0x135 suppresses if FID 0x12D0002A != 3. Special IDs have additional gates; the selected eight have none of those ID-specific branches. Existing cached ID 0x247 can delay the next publication by 100 ms. Display mode 2/3 schedules publication after 500 ms.",
    "uiAdditional": "Charge/discharge scenes suppress; scene-mode suppresses except ID 319 decimal; scene-off/downstream popup/menu/phone arbitration also controls visibility.",
    "zeroMeaning": "commonWarningInfoId == 0 clears/hides the popup, including when gates reject a nonzero raw ID. Raw warning ID 0 has no dictionary entry. Neither zero establishes ECU health, a universal OFF state or absence of stored DTCs."
  },
